{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/marquee-and-track-range-walk",
  "seed": "At Next defaults, no flag set: a recording cut at 0:03 and 0:06 on V1 and music under it on its own track. A drag in empty space on V1 draws a box and picks just the piece of the recording it touches; one down across both tracks picks the pieces and the music it touches; a click on empty space lets go. Option-drag on V1 picks a stretch of time on V1 alone, drawn over V1 only: Delete lifts it and the music is untouched, Shift-Delete closes the gap on V1 alone, Cmd-T puts a transition on the cut inside it. R takes the Range tool, which draws the same range without Option.",
  "setup": { "timelineOpen": true, "forget": ["all"]},
